          </p>

          <p>
            Strawberry has one advantage over chocolate that matters for daily drinkers: no cocoa. Cocoa is a major source of cadmium and lead in protein powder, and independent testing has found chocolate powders carry substantially more of both on average than non-chocolate flavors. A strawberry whey removes that source. It does not guarantee a clean tub, because the protein base and processing matter too, but rotating away from chocolate is a simple way to lower exposure. Our <a href="/best-protein-powder-without-heavy-metals/">protein powder without heavy metals</a> guide covers the testing in more depth.
          </p>

